 \n\nWeekly run of approximately 5km on the hills to start your day.\n\nPace
 : We will average between 8-9min/km overall. Running the flats/downs\, and 
 walking or run/walk the ups.\nNo one left behind.\n\nDistance: 5km\n\nTime:
  ~45 minutes\n\nMeeting point: The Buzzards in Rosebank Gardens\n\nHeadtorc
 hes definitely needed!\n\nPlease remember to click out if you can no longer
