SUMMARY:Straight Outta Compton / Roll(right) with it - Double A-side - Adventure (10.6 miles in 2 hours ish)
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sim Buzzard\n\n10.6 mile trail run from Little Compton 
 to Great Compton taking in a visit to the Rollright Stones. Run followed by
  a sarnie or cuppa if cafe open (otherwise stop off on way back to Malvern)
 . Expect to be out for 2 - 2.5 hours to allow for photos and map checking.\
 n\nDress for the weather and bring supplies.\n\nLiRF@ Sim Buzzard [Phone Nu
 mber Redacted]\n\nLeaving Malvern about 07:00 and please car share if you c
 an.\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/344
